{"title":"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bb00fd4fc037231c6736d08be2c4308be14e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5ada79ddc8836401d8d26232fd810513063fe68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y + 2 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad448c942032df6fe4b8dd232912bbe6afc8cfed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/1066840dc89b054b5f485d1e33e9c48b6a716620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 19 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 21 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 23 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solving the equations for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/b/48bb00fd4fc037231c6736d08be2c4308be14e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"86\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d31b4326c2ce443beff50b8d5e0389b1a04874.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/d/5ada79ddc8836401d8d26232fd810513063fe68b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y + 2 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/f/ebf7372463bef60a62140dcd2db27f0e768f6af4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"63\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/9/889f56ce08684be3b2ab9914892de17686ae9594.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Plugging this into the expression, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/056d2f3f3a3c6684288ace779a886fd237a2dc4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y = 2 \\times 3 + 3 \\times 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/d/77d5c08168b8d9f9a8b158a6d0d0b7245c3ab324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=6 + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"71\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa221eb0d16e5f20b5b7172fe05c16388250dfb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"86\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can notice that the first equation contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/c/2ec701493fa72dda5d6747fe14f30e7b1c2fb6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> and the second equation contains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/89385605cebfe24cd5d7a9402a2908b64a012fa4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"16\" />, like in the expression. This means that we can simply add the equations, and solve for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad448c942032df6fe4b8dd232912bbe6afc8cfed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfa0f6a76dcbc0813ec9b15c8935ec4eaab9a69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 1 + 3y + 2 = 5 + 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"199\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f02c6c87060d9ca29d886f40c7e6fad7cfd0a4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y + 1 = 22$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f5b01fa0c89175c4a78881ff430e3db376eeff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x + 3y = 22 - 1 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(C) } 21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"225\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal\">1999 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"CEMC Pascal\">CEMC Pascal</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192944\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 182/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2050/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 310/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3893/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.605      1 Template:CEMC_box\n100.00%    7.605      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32781:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017192944 and revision id 272123. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}